{"content":[{"c":["TRADITION"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Respect for tradition was particularly strong among Jews during the period at the beginning of the Christian era. Among these traditions, the most important collection was ",{"c":["Pirke Aboth"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," (Traditions of the Fathers). This consisted of comments by famous rabbis in explanation of the written Law. This and a growing collection of other rabbinic traditions interpreting the Law became an authoritative commentary on the written code. This collection was esteemed to be equal to the written Law."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["The Pharisees used the expression “tradition of the elders” when speaking to Jesus about hand washing (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.15.2","r":"Matt.15.2","rawR":"Matt.15.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.15.2","value":"Matt.15.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 15:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mark.7.5","r":"Mark.7.5","rawR":"Mark.7.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mark.7.5","value":"Mark.7.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mk 7:5"},"). In his response, Jesus referred to the “traditions of men,” thus drawing attention to their human origin. In fact, in ",{"href":"?bref=Mark.7.8","r":"Mark.7.8","rawR":"Mark.7.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mark.7.8","value":"Mark.7.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mark 7:8"},", he definitely set the commandment of God over these traditions, which had become a burden to the people. Jesus strongly criticized the scribes and Pharisees for the way these traditions were enforced (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.23.1-39","r":"Matt.23.1-39","rawR":"Matt.23.1-39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.23.1-39","value":"Matt.23.1-39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 23"},"). He noted that adherence to the tradition had become more important than the moral and personal effect of the teaching."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Judaism_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Judaism_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Judaism_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Judaism"},"; ",{"href":"?item=LawBiblicalConceptof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LawBiblicalConceptof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LawBiblicalConceptof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Law, Biblical Concept of"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Pharisees_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Pharisees_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Pharisees_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Pharisees"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Talmud_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Talmud_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Talmud_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Talmud"},"; ",{"href":"?item=TraditionOral_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"TraditionOral_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"TraditionOral_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Tradition, Oral"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Tradition","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Mt 15:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.15.2","rawQueryValue":"Matt.15.2","sourceRefExact":"Matt.15.2"},{"anchorText":"Mk 7:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Mark.7.5","rawQueryValue":"Mark.7.5","sourceRefExact":"Mark.7.5"},{"anchorText":"Mark 7:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Mark.7.8","rawQueryValue":"Mark.7.8","sourceRefExact":"Mark.7.8"},{"anchorText":"Mt 23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.23.1-39","rawQueryValue":"Matt.23.1-39","sourceRefExact":"Matt.23.1-39"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"2b0a0614ffb9d4e3c99c7b2877bb4303fe516b65950b302b8dfbabc16a1b1183","sourceItemName":"Tradition","sourceItemOrder":222,"sourceMember":"Articles/T.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Tradition","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Tradition","title":"Tradition","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}